Subject: Using Pardiso to speed up computations on a Windows server with 32 cores
Message-ID: <mi9VdCoMzBQ.gjUwWKSDCAAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/r-inla-discussion-group/c/mi9VdCoMzBQ/m/gjUwWKSDCAAJ>
